<title>АТЛАС ТЕНЕЙ — Печать I</title>
<style>
:root{--ink:#0d1015;--panel:#15191e;--panel2:#1b2025;--warm:#eee5d5;--muted:#afa898;--gold:#cfaf7c;--gold-soft:#9a815f;--red:#a94c4b;--line:#64554055;--teal:#9ac9ad;--yellow:#edce83;--glow:#d5ae6c38;--radius:16px;color-scheme:dark}
